// Signal box: a brick locking room below, the operating floor above in timber, glazed all round, so whoever's up there
// sees the whole yard. Outside stairs up the east end to a landing and the upper door.
// Wall segments: 0 north (x 0→8), 1 east (z 0→4), 2 south (x 8→0, at_m = 8 − x), 3 west (z 4→0, at_m = 4 − z).
